{"ID":"20240220132601-1eh3d7i","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132601-1eh3d7i","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132601-1eh3d7i\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171845-evipnec\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171845-4onf00k\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:119,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171845-4onf00k\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:108,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:108\u0026#125;","title":"【乌梅丸】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312171845"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312171845-evipnec","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171845-evipnec","updated":"20240312171845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三百五十三条、第三百五十四条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171845-tb5vd4w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171845-tb5vd4w","updated":"20240312171845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「伤寒」，脉微而厥，至七八日，肤冷，其人躁，无暂安时者，此为藏厥。非若蚘厥也。蚘厥者，其人常自吐蚘。今病者静，而复时烦，此为蚘厥。蚘上入膈，故烦。须臾复止，得食而呕又烦者，蚘闻食臭出，其人当吐蚘也，蚘厥者，「乌梅丸」主之，又主久利。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171845-ydqthah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171845-ydqthah","updated":"20240312171845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个是寒热并结，专门治疗有寒有热的时候的一个处方。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171845-tvktoyi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171845-tvktoyi","updated":"20240312171845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"伤寒脉微而厥，如果真正的是太阳伤寒，应该是脉浮而紧。“「伤寒」，脉微而厥，至七八日，肤冷，其人躁，无暂安时者，此为藏厥。”脏里面阴寒很盛的时候，病人会烦躁，阳会往外走，脉很小，这个是持续的，一直烦躁，藏结很危险，阴寒很盛，脏里面的阳往外走，所以病人不断的烦躁。阴阳在分隔的状态之下，这是藏结。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"藏结病人一定烦躁"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171845-nq6p2rl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171845-nq6p2rl","updated":"20240312171845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"乌梅丸除了去虫以外还有久利"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171845-6ct0aq3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171845-6ct0aq3","updated":"20240312171845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虫在肚子里生起来。会有虫一定是肠胃寒湿，才会长虫。所以虫的体温跟胃的体温相等，它才可以活在里面，因为胃比较冷。病人安安静静，有虫在里面没有动。为什么说‘而复时烦’当想吃东西的时候，虫也抢着吃，虫就往上膈走，虫往上膈的时候，会觉得很烦。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171845-iajsfa1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171845-iajsfa1","updated":"20240312171845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“须臾复止，”因为饥不欲食，没有东西吃，虫又回去，烦就停掉了。如果吃东西硬吃下去，得食则呕，又烦，虫一直往上逆。「乌梅丸」主之，又主久利，最主要是用在那些比较神经质的人哦。每逢考试必下痢，乌梅丸症。舌头黄湿，乌梅丸有寒有湿在里面。有时候心包经有湿热，痰梗在这边，胃是冷的，肠胃是冷的，心包是热的，这个就是乌梅丸，这个就是久利。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"心包是相火。什么叫相火？相火就是欲望"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，人的欲念。考试到了，心包有积痰，考试他就很紧张，肠胃是冷的，下痢。看到病人"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"紧张下痢"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，舌苔是黄的，舌为心表，其实肚子里是寒的，久利一般是寒利。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"最常见的就是病人一考试就下痢，乌梅丸就讲完了。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171845-4qgl4x7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171845-4qgl4x7","updated":"20240312171845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乌梅丸还有一个是去虫的性，为什么乌梅丸能去虫？这个跟虫本身的性有关系，这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"虫一遇到酸不动"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"了。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"辣一吃到虫就服从了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"虫一吃到苦就逃走了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"乌梅丸就把中药最苦的，最辣的，最酸的的放在一起"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。把乌梅找出来，乌梅还不够酸，泡醋里面泡一个晚上。那老师你说虫这么笨吗？不去吃饭而去吃乌梅，所以说设计乌梅丸的人有一套，他"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"想办法让虫吃到乌梅，人吃到饭"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171845-5go2z30","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171845-5go2z30","updated":"20240312171845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"乌梅丸方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171845-huetd2l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171845-huetd2l","updated":"20240312171845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"乌梅三百个。细辛六两。干姜十两。黄连一斤。当归四两。附子六两炮。蜀椒四两炒去汗。桂枝六两。人参六两。黄柏六两。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171845-kyognuz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171845-kyognuz","updated":"20240312171845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右十味，异捣筛，合治之。以苦酒渍乌梅一宿，去核，蒸之，五升米下，饭熟，捣成泥，合药令相得，内臼中，与蜜，杵贰千下，丸如梧桐子大。先食饮，服十丸，日三服，稍加至二十丸，禁生冷、滑物、臭食等。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171845-uy3c45a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171845-uy3c45a","updated":"20240312171845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这十味药，分开捣筛。苦酒就是黑醋泡乌梅一个晚上，然后把核去掉然后用五升米去蒸。“五升米下”一点的米，不用很多的米，就是为了让五谷的味道入味，吸引虫来吃。饭熟后将乌梅跟其他药捣成泥，再跟蜂蜜混合在一起，捣两千下，不用真的捣两千下，彻底捣烂就好了。然后做成丸。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171845-gklzn8z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171845-gklzn8z","updated":"20240312171845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“先食饮”就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"饭前吃"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。饭前吃的时候，你一吃乌梅丸，虫它闻到是蜂蜜、米的味道，结果一咬下去，又酸又苦又辣，虫就往回跑啊，这个时候你吃饭下去，结果就是你吃到饭，虫吃到乌梅，从大便里面逃出来。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171845-7yapqjx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171845-7yapqjx","updated":"20240312171845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乌梅三百颗用肉，没有用壳的。一次吃十颗，一天吃三次，严重可以加到二十颗，一天三次，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"吃乌梅丸期间禁生冷"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171845-4onf00k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171845-4onf00k","updated":"20240312171845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有虫的人，消化系统不好，血会比较亏一点，肚子很大，饥又不吃东西，面黄肌瘦。这个时候张仲景才用到一点当归。所以张仲景非必要不用当归。不是当归不好，如果很健康可以吃当归，生病的时候不要吃。当归补血。人参补气，肠胃的津液。"}]}]}